+6.  Bind the pipeline state corresponding to `pipeIdx`.
+7.  Bind the descriptor ranges defined in the pipeline layout.
+8.  Execute the draw call: `DrawIndexed(m_numIndices, instanceCount, 0, 0, 0)`.
 
